# Reproducible release artifacts are built locally and by CI.
/dist/
*.vsix

# The extension has no local Node dependency graph. This entry prevents an
# accidental npx configuration from entering a commit.
node_modules/

# Harness configuration lives at the workspace root, never in a repository.
.claude/

# `go build ./cmd/<name>` run at the root leaves the binary here. The Makefile
# and the tests run every command with `go run`, so none is ever committed.
/manifest-version
/repository-audit
/vsix-audit
/vsix-repack
